  "portal_description": "A list of bugs fixed in this update is available in the Technical Notes\nbook:\n\nhttps://access.redhat.com/documentation/en-us/red_hat_virtualization/4.3/html-single/technical_notes\n\nChanges to the ovirt-engine-sdk-python component:\n\n* Previously, the python-ovirt-engine-sdk4 package did not include the all_content attribute of the HostNicService and HostNicsService. As a result, this attribute was effectively unavailable to python-ovirt-engine-sdk4 users. The current release fixes this issue by adding the all_content parameter to the python-ovirt-engine-sdk4. (BZ#1718141)\n\nChanges to the ovirt-hosted-engine-setup component:\n\n* Before this release, local storage pools were created but were not deleted during Self-Hosted Engine deployment, causing storage pool leftovers to remain.\nIn this release, the cleanup is performed properly following Self-Hosted Engine deployment, and there are no storage pool leftovers. (BZ#1843089)",
